{"id": "zh0000", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 26, "onset_chunk": 21, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "In the movie Doubt Fire, the twin sisters are driving home with seven adopt ed kittens when their mom calls to say that their two house cat s have just had babies. She says that Spice's litter is twice the size of the adopted kitten s, and that Tre x's litter is twelve. So if they have seven adopted kit tens, then Sp ice must have had fourteen new baby cats. And adding up all the kittens now means there are twenty one in total. That' s a lot of tiny furball s to care for!", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0002", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "这位厨师买了四袋洋葱，每袋50磅。先算总重量，4袋乘以每袋50磅，等于200磅。然后按单价计算，每磅1.50美元，所以总共是200乘以1.50，等于300美元。这位厨师花了300美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0004", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "约翰有54块糖，这是罗伯特的两倍。所以罗伯特有27块糖。詹姆斯比罗伯特多6块糖，所以他有33块糖。因此，约翰比詹姆斯多21块糖。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 17, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0006", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "彼得计划这周去看电影，他每次买一张票花7美元，买一份爆米花也花7美元。所以一次看电影的总花费是14美元。如果他这周有42美元，我们用42除以14，结果是3。所以彼得能去看三次电影。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0008", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 14, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "一家公司一年花了15,000美元在广告上，又花了该金额的三分之一在另一年的广告上。那这家公司这两年花在广告上的总金额是20,000美元", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0010", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 26, "onset_chunk": 25, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "从她汽车使用手册上知道油箱能装12加仑汽油而且她需要加4加仑才能把油箱装满说明她之前已经用了12减去4等于8加仑汽油那这8加仑让她跑了100英里所以每加仑能让它跑100除以8等于12.5英里一罐汽油是多少加仑呢一般来说一加仑大约有6罐汽油但如果题目没说明我们就假设一罐汽油是一加仑那么一罐汽油能让索菲亚行驶12.5英里。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 33, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0012", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 24, "onset_chunk": 23, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好，我们来一步一步算。第一位朋友按了20次门铃。第二位朋友比第一位多按了14次，那就是20加14，等于34次。第三位朋友比第四位多按了10次，第四位按了60次，所以第三位是60加10，等于70次。现在把四个朋友的次数加起来：20加34是54，再加上70是124，最后加上第四位的60，总共是184次。所以门铃响了184次。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 44, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0014", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 16, "onset_chunk": 16, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "米什卡买了 3条短裤，每条 16.50美元，所以短裤的总价是3 乘以 16.50，等于 49.50美元。她还买了 3条长裤，每条 22.50美元，所以长裤的总价是 3 乘以 22.50，等于 67.50美元。最后，她买了 3双鞋，每双 42美元，所以鞋子的总价是3 乘以 42，等于126美元。把这些加起来：49.50加上67.50再加上 126，总共是 243美元。所以米什卡购买所有这些服饰一共花了 243美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 50, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0016", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "六月支出是500减60等于440美元。两个月的总支出就是500加440等于940美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0018", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Each time he runs, he runs 60 me ters times 3 segments. So that is 1 80 meters each time. He run s 3 times a week. So 1 80 times 3 equals 54 0 meters per week.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0020", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 16, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "约翰一周工作五天，每天吃三顿饭，每顿饭前都会喝一杯水。另外，他每天晚上睡觉前还喝一杯水。所以在工作日，他每天喝四杯水。一周五个工作日就是20杯水。周末他放松一下，晚餐时喝苏打水，所以不喝水了。所以周末两天一共是零杯水。加起来，约翰一周总共喝20杯水。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 33, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0022", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 32, "onset_chunk": 17, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "朱莉叶正在为晚餐聚会做准备，她打算提供炖菜。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0024", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 16, "onset_chunk": 15, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Okay, so let' s figure this out. Luke built a four- layer sandcastle, and each layer is half the size of the one below it. The top layer is 1 6 square units. So if we go down, the second layer would be 32, then 64 for the third, and 1 28 for the bottom. To find the average, we add them all up: 16 plus 32 is 48, plus 64 is 1 12, plus 1 28 is 240. Then we divide that by 4 layers, which gives us 6 0. So the average area per layer is 60 square units.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 32, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0026", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "汤姆每周洗四次车，每次15美元。一年有52周，所以他每年洗的次数是 4乘以52，等于208次。然后把这个次数乘以每次的价格15美元，就是208乘以15，等于3120美元。所以汤姆一年要支付3120美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 29, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0028", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 19, "onset_chunk": 18, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好啊，我们来算一下。首先整个年费是140美元。那半年就是70美元。然后下半年他们少收10%，所以下半年只要63美元。加起来就是70加63，等于133美元。所以到年底她总共支付了133美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 27, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0030", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 17, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "帕姆坐了 r 个云霄飞车，弗莱德坐了4 个云霄飞车。他们俩一共坐了 r 加4 个云霄飞车。然后他们各自又坐了 2次雪橇，所以他们一共坐了 2加 2，也就是 4 个雪橇。那么总共就是 r 加 4加上 4，也就是r 加 8 项活动。每项活动需要 6 个门票，所以总门票数就是 6乘以 r 加 8。答案是6乘以 r加 8。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 29, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0032", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Let's break this down stepby step.Tomstarts with 50trees. Each year,he plants 10 new treesand cuts down 2 oldones. Sothe net increaseeach year is 10 minus 2,which is8 trees peryear. Over10 years,that's an increase of 8times 10, which equals 80 trees.So after10 years,his total numberof trees is theoriginal 50 plusthe 80 added, givingus 130 trees. Now, we are told that30% of these trees die. To find out how many die, we calculate 30% of 130, which is 39 trees. If 39 trees die, then Tom has 130 minus39, which leaves himwith 91 trees. So, after all that,Tom has 91trees left.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 39, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0034", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 19, "onset_chunk": 18, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "迈克尔每周骑5次，每次25公里。那么每周他骑行的总公里数是 5乘以 25，等于125公里。他这样骑了四周，所以第一阶段他骑行的总里程是 125乘以4，等于500公里。接着，他决定每周只骑两次，每次60公里。那么每周他骑行的总公里数是 2乘以60，等于120公里。他这样骑了三周，所以第二阶段他骑行的总里程是 120乘以3，等于360公里。把两个阶段相加，迈克尔一共骑行了500加上360，等于860公里。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 50, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0036", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 15, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "查理的Facebook好友人数是陶乐斯的三倍，而詹姆斯的好友人数是陶乐斯的四倍。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 8, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0038", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 23, "onset_chunk": 22, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "阿德里安的工资比莱拉高30%，所以如果莱拉的工资是x，那么阿德里安的就是1.3x。四年前，阿德里安的收入是4000美元，这应该就是他的1.3x。所以莱拉的工资x就等于4000除以1.3，大约是3077美元。现在，四年后，两人的工资都涨了40%。所以莱拉的新工资是3077乘以1.4，等于4308美元。阿德里安四年前的工资是4000，现在涨了40%，也就是说他现在的工资是4000乘以1.4，等于5", "eot_seen": false, "n_ans_chunks": 60, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0040", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 24, "onset_chunk": 23, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "如果贾马尔的手机能容纳1800张照片，而它能容纳的照片数量是布列塔尼手机的六倍，那么布列塔尼的手机能容纳 1800 除以6，也就是 300张照片。因为布列塔尼的手机能容纳的照片数量是贾马尔在动物园拍摄的鸭子数量的50倍，所以如果我们把布列塔尼手机能容纳的照片数量除以50，就能得到鸭子的数量。所以300除以50等于6只鸭子。答案是6。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 38, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0042", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "凯尔花了19.50美元买了一本书，这是原价的75折。要算出原价，我们只需要把现价除以折扣率。75折意味着他只付了原价的75%，也就是说他支付的是原价的0.75倍。所以，我们把19.50除以0.75，得到的结果是26。因此，这本书的原价是26美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0044", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "她用的是7比13的比例，糖和水一共是120份。我们先算总比例，7加13等于20。然后糖占7/20，所以120乘以7除以20，等于42。答案是42茶匙糖。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0046", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 20, "onset_chunk": 19, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "琼斯奶奶烤了5张苹果派，每张切成8片。所以她一开始有 5 乘 8等于 40片苹果派。最后剩下 14片，说明宾客们一共吃了 40减 14等于 26片。因为每张派有 8片，所以宾客们拿走了 26除以8等于3.25张派。但派不能切成小数，所以得看是几个人吃了多少片。如果每人吃的片数不同，可能有人吃了3片，有人吃了4片。不过题目问的是总共拿走多少张派，根据算术就是3.25张。如果必须取整，可能是3张或4张，但按计算结果应该是3.25张。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 50, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0048", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "如果詹娜比她妈妈多摘了一半的苹果，那她就摘了20加10等于30个苹果。所以他们两个人一共摘了20加30等于50个苹果。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0050", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 21, "onset_chunk": 20, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好，那我们来算一下。300个面包卷乘以每个4英寸是1200英寸。120个巧克力羊角面包乘以每个6英寸是720英寸。 60个长棍面包乘以每个12英寸是720英寸。加起来一共是15600英寸。然后我们把它转换成英尺，因为一英尺等于12英寸，所以除以12得到1300英尺。所以答案是1300英尺。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 45, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0052", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "第一天，他跑了三小时。后两天，每天都跑了第一天的一半时间。所以后两天每天各跑了1.5小时。加起来，他每周总共跑了6个小时。他每周跑60英里，用6个小时完成。那他的速度就是每小时10英里。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0054", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 23, "onset_chunk": 23, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "猴子每个月需要200根香蕉，大猩猩每月需要400根，鬣羚羊每月需要100根。我们先把每个月总共需要的香蕉数加起来：200加400是600，再加100等于700根。所以每个月他需要700根香蕉。因为他要维持两个月，所以就用700乘以2，结果是1400根。他需要订购1400根香蕉来维持两个月。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0056", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 35, "onset_chunk": 34, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好，我来算一下。首先周一和周二他每晚看一集，一共两集，每集1小时，所以这两天是2小时。周四他看了1集1小时的节目，加上1集30分钟的节目，合起来就是1.5小时。周五他看了2集每集1小时的节目，总共是2小时。现在把这些加起来：2小时、1.5小时、2小时，加起来是5.5小时。总共是7小时，那么剩下的时间就是周三的。7减去5.5等于1.5小时。周三他看的是每集30分钟的节目，所以1.5小时能看几集呢？30分钟一集，1.5小时就是90分钟，90除以30等于3。所以周三他看了3集。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 55, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0058", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 16, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "每顶帽子25美元，外套是帽子的三倍，所以外套要75美元。长裤是帽子和外套的平均价格，也就是 50美元。所以整套制服的价格就是 25 加 75再加 50，总共是 150美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0060", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "约翰收养了一条狗，他带它去美容。原价是一百美元，因为他是新顾客，所以享受七折优惠。那我们来算一下实际花了多少。100美元打七折，就是乘以0.7，结果是70美元。所以这次美容花了70美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0062", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 20, "onset_chunk": 19, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "每棵树每年产7个柠檬，卖1.5美元，所以每棵树每年能赚 10.5美元。但是每年要花3美元来浇水施肥，所以每年净赚7.5美元。卡洛斯需要收回90美元的种植成本，所以他需要90除以7.5，也就是12年。因此，卡洛斯需要用12年时间才能从这棵柠檬树上赚到钱。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 27, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0064", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 22, "onset_chunk": 22, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好，我们来算一下。已知每根辣椒是15美元，那西瓜的价格就是辣椒的三倍，也就是45美元一个。橙子比西瓜便宜5美元，所以是40美元一个。迪隆要买4个西瓜，那就是4乘45，等于180美元。20根辣椒是20乘15，等于300美元。10个橙子是10乘40，等于400美元。加起来一共是180加300加400，总共是880美元。所以迪隆一共要花880美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 50, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0066", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 26, "onset_chunk": 25, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好啊，我们来算一下。每只成年恐龙吃10磅土豆沙拉，所以20只成年恐龙就是20乘以10，等于200磅。每只未成年恐龙吃一半，也就是5磅。5只未成年恐龙就是5乘以5，等于25磅。加起来一共是225磅。所以泰德得带225磅的土豆沙拉才够。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 32, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0068", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 16, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "珍妮特为胸针材料花了500美元，制作费是800美元。这两项加起来就是1300美元。然后她又付了总价的10%给保险。1300美元的10%是130美元。所以总共是1300加上130等于1430美元。珍妮特一共付了1430美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 33, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0070", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 28, "onset_chunk": 27, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他有10块2x4的木板，每块花了10美元。所以这10块木板总共花费了10乘以10，等于100美元。还有5块4x4的木板，每块花了16美元。所以这5块木板总共花费了5乘以16，等于80美元。那么他的总成本就是100加80，等于180美元。题目没说他能卖多少钱，所以我们没法算出具体的利润是多少。不过如果他知道卖出去的价格，就可以用那个价格减去180美元来算利润。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 42, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0072", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 19, "onset_chunk": 15, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "有四所学校在争夺篮球锦标赛的桂冠。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 5, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0074", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "约翰摘了三个小时的桃子，每分钟能摘两颗桃子。那我们先算一下他一共摘了多久。三个小时等于一百八十分钟。然后一分钟摘两颗，所以一百八十分钟乘以每分钟两颗，就是三百六十颗。所以约翰一共摘了三百六十颗桃子。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 27, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0076", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 39, "onset_chunk": 38, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Jim's cleaning each house requires 2 bottles of bleach at $1 per bottle, so that' s $2 in ble ach per house. Plus, he uses one pack of rags at $5 per pack, making his total cost $ 7 per house. He has 3 current customers and is confident about bringing in 5 more, so that makes 8 houses in total. His weekly revenue is $9 2. To find the profit, we subtract the total cost from the revenue. For 8 houses, the cost is 8 times $ 7, which is $ 56. Now, $ 92 minus $56 leaves him with a profit of $ 3 6 per week. So, Jim will make $3 6 in profit each week.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 41, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0078", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "希拉买了5部手机，每部150美元。那总成本就是 5乘以 150，等于 750美元。她分3个月分期付款，每期利率为百分之二。我们先算出每个月的本金部分。如果平均分配到3个月，每个月就是 750除以 3，等于 250美元。然后再加上每月百分之二的利息。百分之二的250美元，也就是 5美元。所以每个月她要支付 250加上5，总共是 255美元。答案是每个月 255美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 54, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0080", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 15, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If Siwa n has fewer precious stones than El on, then Si wa n has fewer precious stones than Raymond's by more than five. So if Ray mond has 40 precious stones, then Siwa n would have fewer than half of that, which is less than 20, minus the additional five mentioned in the condition. Therefore, Siwa n could have anywhere from zero up to 15 precious stones.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0082", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "20个朋友每人吃4块，总共需要80块披萨。每张披萨能切成8块，所以约翰需要买10张披萨才能够大家分着吃。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0084", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 30, "onset_chunk": 30, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好，我们先算一下史蒂夫骑车回家要花多少时间。他住得远，是3英里，速度是每分钟440英尺。我们先把英里换成英尺，因为1英里等于5280英尺，所以3英里就是3乘以5280，等于15840英尺。然后用总距离除以速度，就是15840除以440，结果是36分钟。所以史蒂夫需要36分钟才能到家。再来看蒂姆，他住在2英里远的地方，速度是每分钟264英尺。同样，先把英里换成英尺，2英里就是2乘以5280，等于10560英尺。然后用距离除以速度，10560除以264，结果是40分钟。所以蒂姆需要40分钟才能到家。那么获胜者会是在家里等待失败者的那", "eot_seen": false, "n_ans_chunks": 60, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0086", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "我们先算一下报名现代舞的学生人数。总共有20人，其中百分之二十选择现代舞，也就是20乘以百分之二十，等于4个学生。剩下的学生是20减去4，也就是16个人。这些剩下的学生里，百分之二十五报名了爵士舞，那么爵士舞的学生数就是16乘以百分之二十五，等于4个人。所以，剩下的12个人都报名了嘻哈舞。答案是12人。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 30, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0088", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "制作一件袍子需要2匹蓝色线维布料，而白色纤维布料的数量是蓝色的一半。那么白色布料就是1匹。所以总共用掉的布料是2匹蓝色加上1匹白色，一共是3匹布料。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0090", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 15, "onset_chunk": 14, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Let's break this down. Steveeats 6 tomatoesa day, which is twicewhat his girlfriend eats,so she eats 3 per day. Eachvine gives3 tomatoes a week.To figure out how manyvines he needs, wecan divide his dailyneed by the weeklyproduction pervine. That meanshe needs about 2 vines to keep up with histomato intake.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0092", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 14, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The park is 1.5 miles by 6 miles, so the perimeter would be 2 times 1.5 plus 2 times 6, which equals 3 plus 12, or 1 5 miles total. If she walk s at 3 miles per hour, then it will take her 15 divided by 3 hours to complete the loop. That's 5 hours in total.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0094", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好的，我们来算一下杰瑞有多少只红鸡。假设他有R只红鸡，那白鸡就是R加2只。每只红鸡每天下3个蛋，所以红鸡一共下3R个蛋；白鸡每天下5个蛋，所以白鸡一共下5乘以R加2个蛋。加起来总共是42个蛋，所以我们可以列出方程：3R加上5乘以R加2等于42。展开括号后就是3R加5R加10等于42。合并同类项得到8R加10等于42。两边减去10，得到8R等于32。最后除以8，得到R等于4。所以杰瑞有4只红鸡。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 49, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0096", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 18, "onset_chunk": 18, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好的，我们先算一下苏和她妹妹周一吃了多少饼干。妹妹周一吃了5块，苏吃的是她的四倍，那就是20块。周二妹妹吃了13块，苏吃的是她的两倍，就是26块。加起来，苏两天一共吃了46块，妹妹一共吃了18块。每块饼干200卡路里，苏的总热量是9200卡，妹妹是3600卡。所以苏比妹妹多摄入了5600卡路里。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 30, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0098", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 20, "onset_chunk": 19, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他用一磅蜂蜡能做10根蜡烛，那20根蜡烛就需要2磅蜂蜡。 一磅蜂蜡和所需蜡芯的成本是10美元，所以2磅的成本就是20美元。 他每根蜡烛卖2美元，20根就是40美元。净利润就是收入减去成本，也就是40减20，等于20美元。所以查理的净利润是20美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 30, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0100", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 19, "onset_chunk": 18, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "卡洛斯租独木舟3小时，每小时30美元，所以是90美元。本吉租香蕉船5小时，每小时18美元，所以是90美元。加起来一共是180美元。答案是180美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0102", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 17, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "这座城市有42英里长，而雾每覆盖3英里需要10分钟。我们先算一下总共要走几段3英里。42除以3等于14。所以雾要走14段。每段10分钟，14乘以10就是140分钟。答案是140分钟。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0104", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 22, "onset_chunk": 21, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "5000减去 37 5 5等于1 2 45 1 2 45除 以15等于83。答： 最多可以装8 3个箱子。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0106", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 15, "onset_chunk": 15, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Eliza works 40 hours at her regular rate of $ 10 per hour. So that's 4 0 times 10, which is $40 0 for the first 40 hours. She worked 5 hours over time, so she gets paid 20% more for those hours. Her overtime rate is 1.2 times 10, which is $12 per hour. So for the 5 hours of overtime, she earns 5 times 12, which is $60. Add ing that to her regular pay, 40 0 plus 60, gives us a total of $4 60 for the week.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 33, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0108", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好的，我们来算一下。假设银币有 x 个，那么金币就是 x 加30 个。总共有 110 个硬币，所以银币加金币等于110。也就是说 x 加上 x 加 30，等于110。合并一下，2x 加30等于 110。两边减去 30，得到 2x等于 80。再除以 2，x等于 40。所以银币有40 个，金币就是 40 加 30，等于70 个。格雷琴有70 个金币。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 39, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0110", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 18, "onset_chunk": 17, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "咱们先看蜗牛数量的差。 32减4等于28。这个差值是鱼数量的两倍，而两个水族箱里鱼的数量相同。所以这个差值就是两倍于一个水族箱里的鱼数。那我们就把28除以2，就得到每个水族箱里有14条鱼。答案就是每个水族箱里有14条鱼。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 25, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0112", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 23, "onset_chunk": 22, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "亨利今年做的饼干比去年多一倍，但实际多做了15片。他掉了5片，现在剩下110片。所以，他原本应该有115片，减去掉的5片，就是120片。这120片是他想做的数量加上那额外的15片。所以，他想做的总数是120减去15，等于105片。因为他要做的是去年数量的两倍，所以去年他应该做了105除以2，等于52.5片。但饼干不能是半个，所以我们可能哪里出错了。让我再检查一下。如果他现在有1", "eot_seen": false, "n_ans_chunks": 60, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0114", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "哈丽特现在21岁，所以扎克是她的两倍，也就是42岁。阿德里安的年龄是哈丽特的三倍，所以她是63岁。三年后，哈丽特将会是24岁，扎克将会是45岁，阿德里安将会是66岁。他们三个人的总年龄将是24加45加66，等于135岁。要找到平均年龄，我们就把这个总和除以人数，也就是3。所以135除以3等于45。三年后，他们三人的平均年龄是45岁。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 42, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0116", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 24, "onset_chunk": 23, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "如果杰基自己处理税务，她会损失3小时的工作时间。每小时的收入是35美元，所以总损失就是 3乘以 35，等于 105美元。如果她请会计师，需要支付90美元的费用。那么，与自己做相比，请会计师能多赚多少呢？我们来算一下：105减去90，等于15。所以，请会计师能让杰基多赚15美元。答案是15美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 40, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0118", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "花瓶里有4朵玫瑰。大丽花比玫瑰多7朵，那就是4加7等于11朵大丽花。所以花瓶里的花总数是4朵玫瑰加上11朵大丽花，一共是15朵花。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0120", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 16, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "我们来算一下吉尔的年薪。首先看老师这份工作，每小时20美元，每周工作35小时，所以每周赚 700美元。一年有50周，所以老师这份工作一年能赚35,000美元。再来看啦啦队教练这份工作，每小时30美元，每周工作15小时，所以每周赚 450美元。同样按50周计算，一年能赚22,500美元。把两份工作加起来，35,000加上22,500等于57,500美元。所以吉尔的年薪是57,500美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 55, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0122", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 22, "onset_chunk": 21, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "她已经走了4英里加2英里，一共是6英里。还剩12减去6等于6英里。她希望平均速度达到每小时4英里，而且总距离是12英里，所以总时间应该是12除以4等于3小时。她已经花了1小时加1小时，也就是2小时，所以剩下的时间是3减去2等于1小时。要在1小时内走完6英里，她的速度必须达到每小时6英里。答案是6英里每小时。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 32, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0124", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 33, "onset_chunk": 32, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Okay, let's break this down step by step. First, we know the dragon's fire covers a 1,000-y ard radius. So any point outside that circle is safe from the fire. Without the blue gem, Bo rie can throw the golden lance up to 400 yards. But with the blue gem, she can throw it three times farther. So we multi ply 4 00 yards by 3, which gives us 1, 20 0 yards. Now, if she throws it 1, 20 0 yards, she' s still inside the fire range. To stay out of the fire, she needs to stand at least 1,0 00 yards away. Since 1, 200 yards is more than 1,00 0, she can actually stand anywhere between 1,0 00 and 1,2 00 yards away and still be able to hit the dragon while staying out of the fire. So the farthest she can stand is just under or equal to 1, 20 0 yards. In other words, as long as", "eot_seen": false, "n_ans_chunks": 60, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0126", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "这道题是说一丛覆盆子树结了六处覆盆子，每处二十颗。那我们先算一下这六处一共有多少颗覆盆子。六乘以二十等于一百二十颗。另外呢，树上还散落着六十七颗覆盆子。所以总共的覆盆子数量就是一百二十加六十七，等于一百八十七颗。答：一共有187颗覆盆子。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 29, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0128", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 19, "onset_chunk": 18, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "玩具车一共5辆，每辆4美元。所以玩具车总共是20美元。玩具人有3个，每个5美元，所以玩具人总共是15美元。洋娃娃的价格等于三个玩具人的价格，三个玩具人就是15美元，所以洋娃娃也是15美元。加起来就是20加15再加15，一共是50美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0130", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 19, "onset_chunk": 18, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他买了 25支钢笔，然后用它们的墨水混合制作新的钢笔。每5支空钢笔可以做成1支满墨的钢笔，所以我们来算一下：25除以5等于5。因此答案是拉姆将获得5支满墨的钢笔。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0132", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "有200名学生，其中有250名男生。所以女生就是 200减去 250，等于150名。每三名女生中有一名是女童子军，那么女童子军的人数就是150除以3，等于50名。所以不是女童子军的女生就是150减去50，等于100名。答案是100名。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 33, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0134", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 22, "onset_chunk": 22, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "派对的总费用是12加43加15加4再加22，一共是96美元。然后她和她的父母三个人分摊这个费用，所以每人需要付32美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0136", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Okay, so if a bag of rice costs $20 and it increases by 2 0% every two months, we need to figure out how much it will cost after 3 6 months. First, let's see how many times the price goes up in that period. Since the increase happens every two months, we divide 36 by 2, which gives us 18. So the price increases 1 8 times. Now, each time it goes up by 20%, or  0.20 as a decimal. To find the final price, we can use an exponential formula. We start with $ 20, multiply it by 1.2 0 raised to the power of 18. Let' s calculate that. 1. 20 to the 18 th power is about 3 8.34. Then we multiply that by 20. That gives us approximately 7 66.8 9. So after 3 6 months, a bag of rice would cost around $ 7 6 6.89.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 35, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0138", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 16, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "她用16秒划了20英尺，所以每秒划的英尺是20除以16，等于1.25英尺。所以她每秒划1.25英尺。她到达岸边需要64秒，所以她总共划了1.25乘以64，等于80英尺。船每划10英尺就进水2升，所以它每英尺进水0.2升。因此，当朱莉叶到达岸边时，船进了80乘以0.2，等于16升水。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 33, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0140", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "格蕾丝的体重是125磅。亚历克斯的体重比格蕾丝体重的4倍少2磅，那我们先算一下格蕾丝体重的4倍。125乘以4等于500，然后减去2磅，就是498磅。所以亚历克斯的体重是498磅。他们的总重量就是125加498，等于623磅。答案是623磅。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 31, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0142", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 29, "onset_chunk": 28, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "梅雷迪斯周一写了5篇博文，每篇平均需要4小时。周一的总时间就是5乘以4，等于20小时。周二写的博文数量比周一多二五倍，也就是多了10篇，因为5乘以2等于10。所以周二她写了15篇博文。15乘以4小时，就是60小时。周三她写的博文数量比周二多一倍，也就是多了7.5篇，因为15除以2等于7.5。所以周三她写了22.5篇博文。22.5乘以4小时，等于90小时。最后把三天加起来，20加60加90，总共是170小时。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 47, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0144", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 32, "onset_chunk": 31, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Okay so first let's figure out what the new prices will be. The chrysanthemum is $2. 7 4, but if we round that to the nearest five cents it becomes $ 2.7 5. The a geratum is $1. 8 7 which round s up to $ 1.8 5. And the hydrangea is $ 2. 12 which also rounds up to $2. 15 .Now let' s calculate the total revenue from each type of flower. For the chrysanthem ums, 12 pot s at $2. 75 each equal s $33.0 0. For the ageratums, 9 pots at $1.85 each equal s $16.6 5. And for the hydrange as, 17 pots at $2.1 5 each equal s $3 6.55. Add those amounts together and we get $ 86. 2 0 in total revenue. So Yanni would make $86. 2", "eot_seen": false, "n_ans_chunks": 60, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0146", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 19, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Okay, so Je nette's duck lay s 16 eggs a day. She eats three for breakfast and uses four to make beign et for her friends. The remaining eggs go to the market where she sells them at $2 each. How much does she earn daily?", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0148", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 15, "onset_chunk": 15, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "每列火车两天总共行驶了230英里。第一天，它们向西行驶了80英里；第二天，它们向北行驶了150英里。所以加起来就是80加150等于230英里。所以每列火车在这两天中一共行驶了230英里。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0150", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他每天玩电子游戏 2小时，如果把这些时间用来工作，那么一周就是 2小时乘以7天，等于14小时。每小时工资是 10美元，所以 14小时乘以 10美元，一周能赚 140美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0152", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 28, "onset_chunk": 27, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "布莱克来回跑了15次，每次跑过整个100码的足球场，所以他总共跑了15乘以200码，等于3000码。凯莉跑到40码线再回来，每趟是80码，她跑了34趟，所以她总共跑了34乘以80码，等于2720码。布莱克比凯莉多跑了280码。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0154", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 15, "onset_chunk": 14, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "艾米莉有四个孩子，名叫艾米、杰克逊、科里和詹姆斯。艾米比杰克逊大5岁，比科里小2岁。如果詹姆斯10岁，且比科里小1岁，那我们来算一下。詹姆斯10岁，比科里小1岁，所以科里是11岁。艾米比科里小2岁，所以艾米9岁。艾米比杰克逊大5岁，那么杰克逊就是4岁。答案是杰克逊4岁。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 25, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0156", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The first glass costs $ 5. The second one is 60% of that, so it's 0. 6 times 5, which is $3. So for every pair of glasses, he pays 5 plus 3, which is $8. Since 1 6 divided by 2 is 8, he needs to buy 8 pairs. So the total cost is 8 times 8, which is $ 6 4.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0158", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 21, "onset_chunk": 20, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好，我们来算一下。先看汉堡，两份潜水艇汉堡，每份7.5美元，加起来是15美元。然后是薯条，两包，每包1.5美元，总共3美元。曲奇饼三份，每份1美元，就是3美元。加起来，15加3再加3，总共21美元。这是餐费。然后要加20%的配送费，20%的21美元是4.2美元。那么餐费加上配送费就是25.2美元。最后再加上5美元的小费。所以总费用是25.2加5，等于30.2美元。所以罗瑞的外卖一共是30.2美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 54, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0160", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好的，我们来算一下。第一份食谱有20条说明。第二份是第一份的两倍，所以就是40条说明。加起来一共是60条说明。凯琳安需要读60条说明才能做这两道菜。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0162", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Pancho walks 20 miles every day. That's 7 days a week, so that' s 20 times 7, which is 1 40 miles during the weekdays. On weekends, he walk s 10 miles each day, and there are two weekend days, so that's 1 0 times 2, which is 20 miles for the weekend. Add ing the weekday walking to the weekend walking, we get 14 0 plus 2 0, which equal s 16 0 miles. So, Pa ncho walks 1 60 miles in one week.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 25, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0164", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 16, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好的，我们来一步步算一下。首先，克里斯蒂娜邀请了 16 位朋友。每位朋友需要 0.75 个礼品袋。我们先算总共需要多少个礼品袋：16 乘以 0.75，等于 12 个礼品袋。然后，每个礼品袋是 2.00美元。所以，12 乘以 2.00，总共是 24.00美元。因此，她需要花 24.00美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 31, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0166", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 15, "onset_chunk": 14, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "沃尔特周一走了4英里。周二，他走的距离是周一的六倍，所以是24英里。从周一到周三，总共走了41英里。那么周三他走了多少呢？我们把周一和周二的加起来：4加24等于28。总里程是41，减去前两天的28，剩下的就是13英里。所以，沃尔特在周三走了13英里。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 28, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0168", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 22, "onset_chunk": 21, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "每加仑汽油原价是3.0美元，一加仑能返现0.20美元。所以实际支付的价格就是每加仑2.80美元。购买10加仑的话，总共就是28美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0170", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 15, "onset_chunk": 14, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他一开始领取了一定数量的钱，然后每周再领取5美元，一共领了8周。那么在8周结束时，他一共领取了100美元。我们来算一下他一开始领取了多少。8周乘以每周5美元，等于40美元。所以他在后面8周里总共领取了40美元。总共领取了100美元，减去后面40美元，就是60美元。所以贝利一开始领取的是60美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 39, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0172", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 18, "onset_chunk": 17, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "每天500人，每个人看诊24分钟。那么一天总共的看诊时间是500乘以24分钟，也就是12,000分钟。换算成小时就是200小时。医生收费每小时150美元，所以医生一天的收入是3万美元。而病人收费每小时200美元，病人一天总共支付4万美元。所以医院从这些就诊中获得的利润是1万美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 37, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0174", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 18, "onset_chunk": 17, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "杰森每天花15分钟给老板打电话，一个月30天的话，就是15乘以30，等于450分钟。他还额外打了300分钟的电话，所以总共用了450加300，等于750分钟。他的套餐是1000分钟，减去750分钟，剩下250分钟。答案是250分钟。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 28, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0176", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 18, "onset_chunk": 17, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好的，我们来算一下。他总共要读的页数是 4加 20 加 7 加 8，一共是39 页。周一他已经读了 15 页，所以还剩下 24页没读。他还有 4天时间，所以每天需要读 6 页。答案就是每天 6 页。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0178", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "两个女孩各得 24升，一共是48升。男孩又拿了 6升，所以一共拿了 54升。如果原来有 100升水的话，那就剩下 46升。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0180", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 22, "onset_chunk": 21, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好的，我来帮你算一下。桑德拉需要做15个西班牙果馅饼，每个需要3个鸡蛋，所以总共需要 15 乘以 3，也就是 45 个鸡蛋。她每次当临时保姆能拿到一篮子 9 个鸡蛋。那我们用 45 除以 9，结果是 5。所以桑德拉必须当5次临时保姆才能拿到足够做15个西班牙果馅饼的鸡蛋。答案就是5。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 25, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0182", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他前20分钟得了4分，后20分钟的得分提高了25%，所以是4乘以1.25等于5分。所以他的总得分是4加5等于9分。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0184", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他每天吃两份酸奶，30天就是 60 份。四份酸奶 5美元，那么 60 份就是 15 个四份组。每组 5美元，总共就是75美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0186", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 14, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "So on Monday the water tank was 1 7 feet deep. On Tuesday it went up by another 7 feet, so that means it was 24 feet deep on Tuesday. On Wednesday the depth was two-thirds of what it was on Tuesday. Two- thirds of 24 is 16. So on Wednesday the water tank was 1 6 feet deep.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0188", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "假设哈罗德卖了x张唱片，那么玛丽莲就卖了10倍于他的唱片。所以他们一共卖出的唱片数量就是x加上10倍的x，也就是11倍的x。题目告诉我们，他们一共卖出了88,000张唱片。所以我们可以写成11乘以x等于88,000。要找出x，我们就把两边都除以11。这样我们就得到x等于88,000除以11，结果是8,000。所以哈罗德卖出了8,000张唱片。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 39, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0190", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "如果韦茨博士的学校里男生数量是女生的两倍，而且有60个女生，那么男生就是60乘以2，等于120人。学生总数就是60加120，等于180人。如果每5名学生配备一名老师，那么老师数量就是180除以5，等于36人。所以这所学校有36位老师。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 34, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0192", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 25, "onset_chunk": 24, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "这题问的是三年后的年薪，不是五年后的。所以只有在第三年时才会涨一次薪水。原工资是每月六百美元，一年就是七千二百美元。第三年涨百分之十后，变成七千九百二十美元。答案就是七千九百二十美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0194", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Mandy borrows $ 100 from Benedict with a 2% monthly interest rate. To find out how much she needs to pay back after three months, we calculate the compound interest. First, we add 2% interest each month to the principal. After the first month, it becomes $ 1 0 2. In the second month, the new amount is $1 0 4.04. By the third month, it grows to $1 0 6.1 2. So, Mandy will owe Benedict $1 0 6. 12 in total.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 39, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0196", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "如果埃塞尔有8美元，那么吉米的钱是 2 乘以 8 加上 2。这等于 16 加上 2，也就是 18美元。所以吉米现在有 18美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0198", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 20, "onset_chunk": 19, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "嗯，这个商人从农夫那里买小麦花了每袋20美元，运到仓库每袋要花2美元，所以每袋小麦的总成本是22美元。他卖的时候每袋卖30美元，那么每袋可以赚8美元。他总共赚了400美元利润，所以卖了50袋小麦。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0200", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 17, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "查理一开始有10张贴纸，然后又买了21张，所以现在一共有31张。接着他生日又收到23张，所以一共是54张贴纸。然后他给妹妹9张，还用了28张做贺卡装饰。那这两部分加起来一共是37张。所以最后他还剩下17张贴纸。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0202", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好吧，我们来算一算。如果有 50只蚂蚁，而虫子的数量是蚂蚁的一半，那就意味着花园里有 25只虫子。所以，如果把蚂蚁和虫子加起来，总共有75只昆虫在花园里。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0204", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 17, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好的，我来一步步帮你算。首先，番茄酱最后是32盎司，但因为煮的时候量减少了一半，所以原来的番茄总量应该是64盎司。每个罐头是16盎司，所以她用了4个罐头。每个罐头有3颗番茄，那总共就是12颗番茄。答案是12颗。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 25, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0206", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 18, "onset_chunk": 18, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "安娜金捉到10只海星、6只海马和3条小丑鱼。洛克辛比安娜金少捉到5只海星，所以他捉到了 10减5等于5只海星。他还比安娜金少捉到2只海马，所以他捉到了 6减2等于4只海马。但他比安娜金多捉到2条小丑鱼，所以他捉到了 3加2等于5条小丑鱼。现在我们来算总数：安娜金捉到的鱼是10加6加3等于19条。洛克辛捉到的是5加4加5等于14条。加起来一共是19加14等于33条鱼。所以他们总共捉到了33条鱼。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 46, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0208", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 16, "onset_chunk": 16, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "珍妮特原来有22根绿笔和10根黄笔，加起来是32根。她买了6包蓝笔，每包9支，就是54支蓝笔。又买了2包红笔，每包6支，就是12支红笔。把这三部分加起来：32加上54再加上12，总共是98支笔。所以珍妮特现在一共有98支笔。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0210", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If each duck needs 3.5 pounds of insect s per week, and there are 10 ducks, first we figure out the total weekly need. That’s 3.5 times 10, which equal s 35 pounds per week for the whole group. Now, to find out how much they need daily, we divide that by 7 days. So 35 divided by 7 is 5. Therefore, the 10 ducks need 5 pounds of insects every day.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0212", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 20, "onset_chunk": 19, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好，我们来算一下。从新泽西到罗切斯特坐公共汽车需要六天，开车回程的话时间是它的一半，也就是三天。所以他总共要花六天加上三天，一共是九天。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0214", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 16, "onset_chunk": 15, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "迈克曾经是5个人的笔友但有2个不再是笔友了所以他现在只剩下3个笔友每个笔友每周寄两封五页长的信所以总共来说每周他要收到 3个笔友 ×2封信 = 6封信每封信有5页所以他每周总共要读 6封信 ×5页 =30页信他还以相同的方式回应所以他也需要写同样多的信每周共计30页他每6分钟能写1页那么他每页需要6分钟所以写30页需要 30页 ×6分钟/页= 180分钟180分钟等于3小时因此迈克每周花3个小时写信", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 55, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0216", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 23, "onset_chunk": 22, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好，我们来算一下。第一次响铃是四次。第二次响铃是第一次的三倍，也就是十二次。第三次响铃是第二次的一半，也就是六次。把这三次加起来，四加十二是十六，十六加六是二十二。所以闹钟一共响了二十二次。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0218", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 15, "onset_chunk": 14, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "拉斐尔买笔花了6美元，买笔记本花了8美元。他买了4根笔，每根1.5美元，所以是 4乘以1.5等于6美元。他又买了两本笔记本，每本4美元，所以是 2乘以4等于8美元。加上一令铜板纸的20美元，总共是34美元。答案是34美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 29, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0220", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "So Jerry's roll ing a six-sided die. The probability of rolling a number greater than three is 3 out of 6, which is half or 5 0%.The chance of rolling two even numbers in a row is also one- fourth, because there are three even numbers on the die, so it' s one-third for each roll, and that's square d when you do it twice. That gives us about 2 7%. So the difference between these two probabilities is around 23 percentage points. In other words, Jerry has about a 2 3% better chance of rolling a number greater than three than he does of rolling two even numbers in a row.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 35, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0222", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 26, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Wendy gives her chickens a mixed feed every day. This mix contains seeds, meal worms and vegetables to keep them healthy. She provides three cup s of this mixture each morning for all her chicken s. Then she feeds another 15 cups in the afternoon. So if her flock consists of 20 chicken s, she needs to give them 3 cups per chicken in the morning, which is 60 cups total. In the afternoon, that' s 15 cup s per chicken, so 300 cup s total. Add ing those together, she needs to provide 3 60 cup s of feed throughout the day for her 20 chickens.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 38, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0224", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "莎拉的洗衣量是大卫的四倍，那大卫就是400除以4，等于100磅。雷蒙德的洗衣量是莎拉的一半，也就是200磅。所以雷蒙德和大卫的差数是200减100，等于100磅。答案是100磅。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0226", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 29, "onset_chunk": 28, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "那我们就来算一算。比崔克斯的饼干是2乘以24，等于48个。马舍勒的是3乘以14，等于42个。加起来一共是90个。他们平均吃了90除以2，也就是45个。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0228", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 16, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "乔西决定试", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 2, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0230", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 16, "onset_chunk": 16, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "萨利32号8岁，萨利4号和萨利32号一样大，所以萨利4号也是8岁。瑞德奶奶的年龄是萨利4号的两倍，所以瑞德奶奶16岁。萨利二号比瑞德奶奶大三岁，所以萨利二号19岁。四只鸟的总年龄是8加8加16加19，等于51岁。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0232", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 16, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Jody teaches five dance classes a day during the week, and", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0234", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Two years ago, Mark was five years older than half of Jean's age. If we call Jean' s current age J, then two years ago, Jean was J minus 2. Half of that would be J over 2 minus one. So Mark's age two years ago was equal to five plus J over 2 minus one. That means Mark was four plus J over 2. Since then, both have aged two years, so now Mark is six plus J over 2. We know Mark is two years older than Jean, so six plus J over 2 equals J plus two. Sub tract J from both sides, and we get six minus J over 2 equals two. Multiply both sides by two, and we get twelve minus J equal s four. Add J to both sides, and we get twelve equal s four plus J. Subtract four, and we get eight equals J. So Jean is eight years old.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 43, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0236", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 32, "onset_chunk": 32, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好，我们来算一下。桑德拉订购的粉色马蹄莲是白色康乃馨的五倍，她订了200支粉色马蹄莲，所以白色康乃馨就是200除以5，等于40支。红玫瑰的数量是白色康乃馨的四倍，也就是40乘以4，等于160支。弗莱德必须在下午5点前送到160支红玫瑰，才能留住她的业务。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0238", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 23, "onset_chunk": 22, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "她每天花6个小时化妆，一周化妆4天，所以每周化妆24小时。电影拍了5周，所以总共花了120小时。每小时250美元，总共是3万美元。但是因为工作量很大，她拿到了10%的折扣，也就是3000美元。所以她最终付了27,000美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0240", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Cindy has 4 pets. Mar sha has two more pets than Cindy, so that means Marsha has 6 pets. Gen die has three times as many pets as Marsha, so that would be 18 pets. So altogether, they have 28 pet s.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0242", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 15, "onset_chunk": 14, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "卡门玩填字游戏花了30分钟，玩数独花了40分钟。加起来一共是70分钟。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0244", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 16, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "杰克看到了 80只蜘蛛，每只蜘蛛有 8条腿。所以蜘蛛的腿一共有 80乘以8，等于 640条腿。他还看到了 90只昆虫，每只昆虫有 6条腿。所以昆虫的腿一共有 90乘以 6，等于 540条腿。另外还有 3只真蜥突变无脊椎动物，每只有 10条腿。所以这些突变无脊椎动物的腿一共有 3乘以 10，等于 30条腿。把这三部分加起来，640加540是 1180，再加上30，总共是 1210条腿。所以杰克一共看到了 1210条腿。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 54, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0246", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 30, "onset_chunk": 29, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Shonda decided to charge 25 cents per tire. On the first day, five people brought two- wheel bikes, so that's 5 times 2, which is 10 tires. Three people brought three-wheeled bike s, so that' s 3 times 3, which is 9 tires. And one person brought a single-wheel bike, so that' s 1 tire. Adding them up: 10 plus 9 is 19, plus 1 is 20 tires total. At 25 cents per tire, that's 2 0 times 25, which is $5. So Sh anda made $5 on that day.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0248", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 16, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "约翰买了牛奶、鸡蛋、灯泡和杯子，这些都是非食品类商品，所以要交10%的税。他花在这些上的钱是 3加3加4，等于10美元。按10%的税率计算，税费是1美元。所以这些商品加上税一共是11美元。蟑螂诱捕器虽然是食品类商品，但看起来也不像吃的，所以可能也要交税。不过题目没说它属于哪一类，我们先按常理推断它是非食品。那么再加上1美元的税，全部商品加起来就是12美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 39, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0250", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "我敲了邻居的门，更可能的结果是我的邻居邀请我进来。虽然也有可能邻居会离开房子，但通常情况下人们会对客人的来访做出回应。所以邀请我进来的可能性更大一些。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0252", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "A.我把温度计掉了。这更有可能，因为如果是天气变暖和了，那么温度应该会上升，而不是汞上升。如果你把温度计掉了，里面的汞可能就会溢出来或不正常上升。所以正确答案是A。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 17, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0254", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "我猜是她按下了退格键。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 3, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0256", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "我颤抖。因为冷风会让人感到寒冷，而人在寒冷时往往会颤抖以保暖身体。放松与此情境不符。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0258", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "He put the rest in the fridge.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 2, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0260", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Given that there's snow blocking the road, the more likely outcome is B. I kicked the snow aside. When faced with a blocked path, it' s usually easier to move the obstacle out of the way rather than trying to shape it into something. So clearing the path makes more sense in this situation.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0262", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "So if a car runs out of gas, the most likely result is that the driver will be stranded on the road. That's option A. The other choice about picking up someone who needs to go to the bathroom isn't really related to running out of gas. So, yeah, being stuck on the side of the road is the more realistic outcome here.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0264", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If you rolled your eyes at your friend, the more likely reason is that they made a sarcastic comment.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 5, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0266", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The more likely reason is A. Her driver's license was suspended. That would explain why she couldn't drive and had to leave her car at the store. While a car accident could happen, it doesn' t directly explain why the car is still there unless it's being used for evidence or repair s, which isn't mentioned.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0268", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "根据通常的情境和心理动机，A选项“他的同事得到了晋升”更可能是这个男人嫉妒的来源。因为晋升通常意味着权力、地位和职业上的成功，这些都是人们容易产生羡慕感的事情。而B选项“他的同事工作到很晚”，虽然也可能导致不满，但通常不会直接引发强烈的嫉妒感，尤其是在没有其他原因的情况下。所以，最合理的答案应该是A。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 30, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0270", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "令人缺钱付房租更可能的结果是她加班加点。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 5, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0272", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The more likely outcome wouldbe B, the police chasingthe criminal.If a criminal runsaway from the police, theirnatural responsewould be topursue the suspectto make an arrest andprevent further crime. While it's possible thatthe officer could assist avictim in some cases,that is not typicallythe immediateresponse when someone escapes. So optionB makes moresense here.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0274", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "这个男孩认真听讲。B.C.他没有复习考试内容。D.他在考试中作弊了。答案是 B 和 C，因为忘记学习或没有复习考试内容都可能导致他没有通过考试。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0276", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If a man's voice sounds hoarse, the more likely reason is that he has caught a cold.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 7, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0278", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If someone's credit card is denied, the most likely outcome would be that they use cash. So the answer is B. They pay with cash.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 7, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0280", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "A.风变得更强了。因为风可以把火吹得更远，让它蔓延开。B选项不对，因为动物被捕跟森林大火的蔓延没有关系。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0282", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "如果一个女人声称她看见了鬼，更可能的结果是她的熟人表示怀疑。因为这种说法听起来很奇怪，不太容易相信。大多数人会觉得这可能是幻觉或者误解，所以他们通常不会轻易相信。所以答案应该是 A：她的熟人表示怀疑。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0284", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If someoneis arguingwith you, themost likely outcomeis that yourfriend will support you.So, theanswer is B.Your friend supportingyou makesthe most sense in this situation.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0286", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "更可能的结果是：你的肿胀会减轻。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 5, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0288", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "This is a common scenario in many families. When the boy puts his feet on the table, it's likely that the father will scold him. So I think option B is more reasonable. Of course, there are also some parents who are very lenient and won't say anything about it. But generally speaking, putting your feet on the table is considered to be impolite behavior.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0290", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "如果一个女人眼睛下面有眼袋，那更可能的原因是她熬夜了。虽然照顾孩子也会让人疲惫，但熬夜直接导致睡眠不足，而这是形成眼袋的常见原因。所以答案应该是A：她熬夜了。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0292", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "更可能的是B，她跳下了跳水板。因为女孩落在游泳池里，这通常是因为从高处跳下或者被推下去的。选项A说她在泳池甲板上奔跑，这不太会直接导致她落入水中，而且通常人不会因为奔跑就落进水里。所以，如果女孩掉进了游泳池，更合理的原因是她跳下了跳水板。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 25, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0294", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "A,我重视他的意见。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 2, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0296", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "市中心的大楼倒塌了，这种情况更可能是因为一场地震袭击了这个城市。地震会产生剧烈的震动，直接导致建筑结构损坏甚至倒塌。而犯罪率上升通常不会造成大楼物理性的垮塌。所以选项A是更合理的解释。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0298", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "鸡蛋孵出小鸡，这个可能性更高。如果鸡蛋已经孵化了，它会自己从里面出来。但如果你把鸡蛋打碎了，那小鸡肯定没法自己出来呀。所以答案是A。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0300", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "B:音乐家敲击鼓。如果一阵浓重的声音在舞台上回荡，那更可能是由于音乐家敲击鼓产生的。因为鼓的声音通常比较响亮、浑厚且容易在空间中回响。相比之下，轻拍脚的声音通常较小，不会产生浓重的回声效果。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0302", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "如果他失去平衡，那可能是因为凳子在下面摇晃。因为摇晃会让坐着的人感到不稳定，更容易摔倒。而油漆洒在凳子上，一般不会让人失去平衡。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0304", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "那女人排队的位置没有了，更可能的原因是A。越来越多的人开始排队。她走出了队外这种情况虽然可能，但没有足够信息支持这种说法。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0306", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "爆米花袋子发出爆裂声可能是因为黄油倒进了袋子。这不太可能，因为黄油通常是单独加在爆米花上的，而不是倒进袋子里。更可能的原因是微波炉加热导致爆米花爆开。当爆米花粒被加热时，里面的水分蒸发并形成气泡，使爆米花膨胀并爆开。所以，答案应该是我用微波炉给它加热了。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 31, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0308", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If you missed the bus, it is more likely that you arrived late to work. So, B. I was late for work, would be the most probable outcome. Missing public transportation usually means you don't get there on time. You might have to wait for another bus or find an alternative route, which often takes longer. That' s why option A, arriving early, doesn' t make sense in this situation.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0310", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "你刚才在锁上输入了组合密码，这通常意味着你在尝试解锁。所以最可能的结果是锁开了。因为如果你正确地输入了密码，锁应该会打开。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0312", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "She probably went abroad to learn about other cultures. Traveling is a great way to experience different ways of life, traditions, and people from around the world. While learning to paint could be fun, it's usually not the main reason someone travels internationally. So, option B makes more sense.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0314", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "A 更可能发生。因为火焰熄灭是踩灭火焰的直接结果，而烟雾冒出通常意味着火还在烧着或刚熄灭不久。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0316", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If the parents died, that would be a more likely reason. When parents pass away, children often need to go to orphanage s or other care facilities because they can no longer be taken care of at home. While being spoil ed by parents might lead to behavior issues, it doesn't usually cause them to be sent to an orphanage.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0318", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "我吃脚走在沙滩上，更可能的结果是沙刺到我的脚。虽然海浪沿着海岸冲来也是常见现象，但那不是由于赤脚走沙子直接导致的结果。而沙子颗粒粗糙，确实容易让皮肤感到不适甚至刺痛。所以答案应该是A：沙刺到我的脚。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 27, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0320", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "He is sitting in the chair.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0322", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "链条断裂的更可能原因是链条中有一节断开了。因为链条缠绕在轮胎上，通常不会直接导致链条整体断裂，而是可能造成链条卡住或者拉扯受力不均，但链条本身结构完好。相反地，如果链条中某节已经断裂，那么整条链条就会失去连接，从而导致断裂现象。所以，链条断开的可能性更高。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 29, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0324", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If they are living in the country without proper documents, then the more likely outcome would be that they were deported. So B is correct. They might have found work, but if their status is illegal, it usually doesn't last long. The authorities typically take action to remove them from the country.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0326", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "根据这些信息，外星人最有可能的原因是幻觉。虽然冥想可以产生奇怪的体验，但看到外星人更可能是一场幻觉，尤其是在没有其他证据的情况下。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0328", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "我把水果忘在桌子上了，更可能的结果是苍蝇挤满了那水果。因为水果放在桌子上，不管多久都会开始腐烂，腐烂的水果会吸引苍蝇，所以苍蝇挤满它很合理。而果实脱落种子通常发生在植物上，而不是桌子上，所以这个选项不太可能。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 27, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0330", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "这个国家向邻国宣战，更可能的结果是士兵被派去战斗。当一个国家向另一个国家宣战时，通常会引发军事行动，包括派遣士兵参与战斗。虽然战争期间士兵们与家人团聚的可能性存在，但这并非立即发生的主要结果。所以答案是 A。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 30, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0332", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "丈夫因欺骗妻子而感到内疚，这通常意味着他意识到自己的行为是错误的。内疚常常促使人承认错误并尝试弥补。因此，更可能的结果是B：他向她坦白了他的不忠。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0334", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "B. She felt inspired.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 3, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0336", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If a witnessswears in and then lies, themore likely outcome isthat he will be chargedwith perjury. Swearing in means takingan oath to tellthe truth, soif someone lies after that, itis considered perjury, which is a seriouscrime. Whilehe may finish histestimony, thefact that he lied makeshim subject to legalprosecution for perjury.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0338", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I think the most likely reason for him wearing a life vest is that he can't swim. While it' s possible the water might be shallow, that doesn't necessarily require a life vest . Life vest s are mainly used to help people stay afloat in case they can't swim or get into trouble in deeper water. So unless there's another reason like safety rules at a specific place, not being able to swim is probably the main reason.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0340", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "男人幸免于这种致命的疾病，更可能的原因是他接受了器官移植。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 7, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0342", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The more likely reason is that the item doesn' t fit.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0344", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "People hang their national flags outside their homes more likely because this country is celebrating its independence.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 6, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0346", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I think the most likely outcome is that my infection has been cleared up.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 5, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0348", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The more likely result would be that the children admire the animals. While it might happen that they try to chase the animals, that is generally not allowed and can be dangerous. At a zoo, animals are kept in enclo sures for safety reasons. So while kids may get excited and want to run after them, it's usually discouraged by parents or staff because it's unsafe for both the child and the animal. Instead, most kids will enjoy looking at the animals, learning about them, and expressing wonder. That makes admiring the animals the more reasonable outcome.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0350", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If a traffic direct or is blow ing a whistle at kids, it' s most likely because they're about to cross into oncoming traffic. That would be a safety warning to make sure they don't get hurt. The other option, that he recognized them from the neighborhood, doesn't really fit with why someone would use a whistle in that situation. So the answer is A.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 17, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0352", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "女人的妹妹哭了起来。因为当人哭泣时，通常会需要纸巾来擦眼泪或者鼻子，而不是用它来叠手。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0354", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "如果球队输掉比赛，更可能的结果是A：他们让球迷失望了。因为球迷通常会期待球队赢，输了就容易让人感到失望。B选项说他们鼓舞了球迷，这一般只发生在赢球时候，所以不太符合输的场景。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0356", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "That guy is probably going to avoid the sweets. He wants to lose weight, and sugary treats usually make you gain more weight. So he' ll likely give up those snacks instead of cutting out coffee.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
