{"id": "zh0360", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "罪犯被处决的更可能原因是他被判犯有谋杀罪。所以答案是B。虽然关进监狱也是一种处罚，但处决通常只适用于犯下极其严重罪行的人，比如谋杀。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0362", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I think the more likely result would be that the paint turns green. When you mix yellow and blue paint, they usually create a green color. The paint fly ing everywhere is less likely unless there was an accident during mixing or application. So the most probable outcome is that the mixture will turn green.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0364", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "She's more likely to work hard. Setting a bold goal usually motivates someone to put in extra effort and stay focused on achieving it, rather than giving up or slack ing off.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0366", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "她看着星星。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 2, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0368", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "He gently shook her shoulder and moved away from her.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0370", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If a player tri es to trip their opponent, the most likely outcome is that B. Their opponent falls to the ground. Try ing to trip someone usually causes them to lose balance and fall. While it might happen that A happens too, it's not as common. So, falling down is more likely than catching the ball when being tripped.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0372", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "更可能的是她的声音听起来很刺耳。嗓子疼时，通常会感觉喉咙发炎或不适，这会导致声音变得沙哑或刺耳。而说话带有口音是语言习惯问题而非嗓子疼的直接结果。所以如果女人嗓子疼，更合理的推测是她的声音听起来很刺耳。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0374", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "我哥哥出院了，更可能的结果是A，我欢迎他回家。毕竟，家人之间有着深厚的情感纽带，尤其是当亲人经历疾病或住院时，大家通常会更加珍惜彼此，表达关爱。B选项显得冷淡，不符合正常的人际关系反应，也不太合理。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0376", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "我开始起疑了。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 2, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0378", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "更可能的原因是我同意他", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 3, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0380", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I think the more likely reason is A. They probably anticipated traffic around the theater. Leaving early to avoid potential congestion makes sense, especially if they want to enjoy their evening without stress.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0382", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "老师表扬学生更可能是因为学生正确回答了问题。因为老师通常会对正确的回答给予肯定和鼓励，而犹豫的回答可能反而会让老师觉得需要帮助或者引导。所以选项A更符合情况。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0384", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "这个学生从大学毕业了，最可能的结果是A，他找工作了。毕业后找工作是很常见的事情。毕业生通常会开始寻找职业机会，以开启职业生涯。虽然有些人可能会继续深造或从事爱好，但找工作是最直接的下一步。所以选A比较合理。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0386", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "饥饿的流浪汉偷走食物更可能的原因是 B:他没有钱。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 6, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0388", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "更可能的原因是他们拍了展品的照片。因为拍照片通常发生在参观过程中，而不是在看完所有展品后才离开博物馆。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0390", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "A.演出的第一幕开始了。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 3, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0392", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "这座著名的雕像被烧毁了，更可能的原因是它被闪电击中了。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 5, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0394", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Given that the boy is locked outside the house, climbing up to the roof would likely be harder than getting in through an open window. So I think the more probable outcome is A: he climb s in through a window that's left open.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
